sequenceDiagram
    participant Auditor as Auditor (User)
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant TMG as Template & Methodology Governance
    participant WAL as Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage

    Auditor->>UI: Select Template Type
    UI->>TMG: Request Latest Template Schema (via API)
    TMG->>DB: Fetch Schema, Rules, Taxonomy
    DB-->>TMG: Return Schema Data
    TMG-->>UI: Provide Schema & Presentation Model
    UI->>WAL: Create New Workpaper (workpaperId, templateType, context: auditEngagementId, businessProcess)
    WAL->>DB: Store Initial Structured Content & Metadata (State: Draft)
    DB-->>WAL: Confirm Storage
    WAL->>EB: Emit Event (WorkpaperCreated)
    EB->>GAL: Log Audit Event
    GAL->>KDS: Append Immutable Event
    WAL-->>UI: Return workpaperId & Initial View
    UI-->>Auditor: Display Editable Workpaper